Description: The goal of the PhosView app is to analyze data from global proteomics experiment associated
             with phosphoproteomics and process with Spectronaut (version >= 20.0) or DIA-NN (version >=2.2) software. 
             It also allows to perform integrated statistical and downstream bioinformatics analysis.
